...turned back. Don't ask if I'm happy.

448
01:00:45,891 --> 01:00:55,651
嘘つくのは 上手じゃない ともだちならいるけど
I'm not good at lying. I have friends...

449
01:00:57,291 --> 01:01:10,491
あなたには もう燃え上がれなくて 失った 夢だけが
...but I can no longer burn with passion for you. Only the dreams I lost...

450
01:01:15,071 --> 01:01:25,471
美しく 見えるのは なぜかしら 過ぎ去った 優しさも今は
...look so beautiful. Why is that? Even the gentle kindness of the past is now...

451
01:01:33,751 --> 01:01:43,311
甘い 記憶 Sweet Memories
...sweet memories, sweet memories.

452
01:01:54,751 --> 01:02:07,651
キスしたら いけないわ 傷をひとつ 増やすだけよ
We shouldn't kiss. It would only add another wound.

453
01:02:10,111 --> 01:02:23,371
長い間 あなたに 会いたくって 泣いていたくせに
Even though I cried for so long, wanting to see you...

454
01:02:26,411 --> 01:02:36,551
あの頃は 若すぎて いたずらに 傷つけあったふたり
Back then, we were too young and foolishly hurt each other.

455
01:02:42,191 --> 01:02:55,811
悲しみも 今は 甘い 記憶 Sweet Memories
Even our sorrow is now sweet memories, sweet memories.

456
01:03:33,071 --> 01:03:42,371
失った 夢だけが 美しく 見えるのは なぜかしら
Only the dreams I lost... look so beautiful. Why is that?

457
01:03:47,871 --> 01:03:54,331
過ぎ去った 優しさも 今は
Even the gentle kindness of the past is now...

458
01:03:56,391 --> 01:04:06,251
甘い 記憶 Sweet Memories
...sweet memories, sweet memories.

459
01:04:48,971 --> 01:04:57,691
フィナーレ。
Finale.

460
01:04:59,971 --> 01:05:04,791
君は 本当に わかってないよ
You really don't understand at all.

461
01:05:05,727 --> 01:05:08,667
たとえば ハッピーエンドより
Rather than a happy ending,

462
01:05:10,387 --> 01:05:14,467
甘くて 豪華な デザートより
sweeter and more extravagant than dessert,

463
01:05:15,067 --> 01:05:18,667
君がいるんだよ
you are right here.

464
01:05:22,127 --> 01:05:25,387
二つの傘より 愛々傘さし
Sharing an umbrella meant for two,

465
01:05:25,527 --> 01:05:29,687
ちょっと冷たいけど 愛するための代償なら
it's a bit cold, but if it's the price for love,

466
01:05:33,467 --> 01:05:41,287
いくらでもどうぞ ただずっとそばにいたい
whatever the cost, please, I just want to stay by your side forever.

467
01:05:42,887 --> 01:05:46,487
ねぇ 欲しくずもない
Hey, we don't need any stardust...

468
01:05:47,787 --> 01:05:54,587
二人ぼっちのセカイでずっと 最後の花火を上げて フィナーレを飾って
In a world of just the two of us, forever, setting off the final fireworks to adorn the finale.

469
01:06:00,087 --> 01:06:09,487
奇跡の恋に落ちて 誰も話さないで
Falling into a miraculous love, don't let go of anyone...

470
01:06:10,467 --> 01:06:15,787
あじけない世界を歩かないね
Don't walk through a dreary world...

471
01:06:16,167 --> 01:06:26,287
どんなに恋をしたって 出逢えないよ きっと終わりのない幸せにキスをしよう
No matter how much we fall in love, we'll surely meet—let's kiss a happiness that has no end.

472
01:06:40,627 --> 01:06:44,787
いつか 今日を忘れても
Even if one day we forget today,

473
01:06:45,527 --> 01:06:49,667
君がいるんだよ
you are here.

474
01:06:50,627 --> 01:06:55,287
天気雨の日 愛々して 初めて目があった
On a sunshower day, the first time our eyes met with love,

475
01:06:55,887 --> 01:07:01,287
ずっと覚えているよ
I'll remember it forever.

476
01:07:27,467 --> 01:07:31,187
ねぇ 欲しくずもない
Hey, we don't need any stardust...

477
01:07:31,687 --> 01:07:37,687
二人ぼっちのセカイでずっと 最後の花火を上げて フィナーレを飾って
In a world of just the two of us, forever, setting off the final fireworks to adorn the finale.

478
01:07:43,127 --> 01:07:52,287
奇跡の恋に落ちて 誰も話さないで
Falling into a miraculous love, don't let go of anyone...

479
01:07:53,627 --> 01:07:58,287
あじけない世界を歩かないね
Don't walk through a dreary world...

480
01:07:58,767 --> 01:08:12,287
どんなに恋をしたって 忘れられないの 終わりがない 幸せにキスをしよう
No matter how much we fall in love, it's unforgettable—let's kiss an endless happiness.

481
01:08:35,281 --> 01:08:47,787
あじけないね でもそれがね 二人の幸せ
It's dreary... but that's why it's our happiness.

482
01:08:55,781 --> 01:09:01,281
Omg, I almost cried! I almost cried singing this song!

483
01:09:02,381 --> 01:09:09,181
Thank you for today, guys! Thank you for today! Thank you... Thank you for watching until the end!

484
01:09:09,781 --> 01:09:19,781
And thank you for Zeta because she covered this Finale song first and then I was inspired so, yeah.

485
01:09:20,081 --> 01:09:22,781
アクバラギャグなのだしに
Akubara generation is right here!

486
01:09:23,381 --> 01:09:29,781
今日来てくれて、最後まで見てくれて、ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for coming today and watching until the very end!

487
01:09:30,381 --> 01:09:39,781
I hope you guys enjoy all the performance... um yeah, this whole stream! Minna daisuki!
I hope you guys enjoy all the performance... um yeah, this whole stream! I love you all!

488
01:09:40,281 --> 01:09:46,281
Thank you for your birthday wishes! 後で読んであげますね！
Thank you for your birthday wishes! I'll read them later, okay?

489
01:09:46,781 --> 01:09:52,281
Bye bye minna! No more encore! No more encore!
Bye-bye everyone! No more encore! No more encore!

490
01:09:52,781 --> 01:10:01,281
バイバイ！ボカボカはコボ・カナエル at your service! Let me be your sun to shine your day!
Bye-bye! Kobo Kanaeru at your service! Let me be your sun to shine your day!

491
